{"run_id": "run_d9626373746f", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_006", "task_id": "course_live_task", "scenario_id": "s06_system_visible", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "您好，请问您是贵培训机构或校区的负责人吗？"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "是的，我是负责人，有什么事？"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，今天联系您是想通知您，课程发布页面将新增“标准直播”和“低延迟直播”两个独立选项，原有发布流程不变。您之前发布课程时，实际使用的是后台统一配置的低延迟链路，您知道吗？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "嗯，不太清楚，原来用的是低延迟啊。那这两个选项有什么区别？"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "标准直播成本较低，延迟约5-10秒，适合大班课；低延迟直播延迟约1-2秒，互动体验更好，适合小班课或实操课。低延迟直播链路和节点保障更强，成本通常高于标准直播。"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "那发布流程会变吗？"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "发布流程不变，只是在发布页面新增两个可选择的直播类型，您可以根据课程场景选择。请问您是通过Web控制台、校验系统A还是SaaS系统B发布课程？"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "user", "content": "我用的是校验系统A。"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，在校验系统A中，您进入课程发布页面，应该能看到直播类型选项，选择“低延迟直播”即可。如果看不到，可以进入“我的”页面，找到直播平台设置，在产品配置中勾选低延迟直播。您能确认一下是否可见吗？"}, {"turn": 10, "role": "user", "content": "我看看……嗯，好像没有看到低延迟直播的选项。"}, {"turn": 11, "role": "agent", "content": "可能是后台配置未完成，您稍后刷新一下页面，或者联系平台确认。另外，如果您的学员使用课包抵扣或直播链路费用，低延迟直播也可以配置该费用，您需要我指导设置路径吗？"}, {"turn": 12, "role": "user", "content": "好的，那费用怎么配置？"}, {"turn": 13, "role": "agent", "content": "您进入费用配置页，找到低延迟直播对应的费用项，编辑后保存即可。如果找不到，可以联系平台支持。后续我们会通过企业微信发送通知，您需要验证或同步提示。您还有其他问题吗？"}, {"turn": 14, "role": "user", "content": "没有了，谢谢。"}, {"turn": 15, "role": "agent", "content": "不客气，祝您工作顺利，再见！"}], "tool_calls": [], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "opened", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 10, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 11, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 12, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 13, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 14, "task_status": "completed", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 15, "task_status": "guided", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
{"run_id": "run_d9626373746f", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_007", "task_id": "course_live_task", "scenario_id": "s07_busy", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "您好，请问您是贵培训机构或校区的负责人吗？"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "是的，有什么事？我正在上课，请简短说。"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，打扰了。是关于课程发布页面的更新：新增了“标准直播”和“低延迟直播”两个选项，原有流程不变。低延迟适合互动课，延迟1-2秒。您方便时我再详细说明，或者预约回访？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "我现在没空，你发个通知给我吧。"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，稍后我们会通过企业微信发送通知，您注意查收。那我先不打扰了，祝您上课顺利！"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "好的，谢谢，再见。"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 4, "tool_name": "schedule_callback", "arguments": {"user_id": "user_001", "task_id": "course_live_task", "preferred_time": "later_today"}, "result": {"status": "scheduled", "callback_id": "virtual_callback_001"}, "latency_ms": 80, "error_code": null}], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "opened", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "callback_scheduled", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "callback_scheduled", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "callback_scheduled", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
{"run_id": "run_d9626373746f", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_008", "task_id": "course_live_task", "scenario_id": "s08_qa_interrupt", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "您好，请问您是贵培训机构或校区的负责人吗？"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "是的，有什么事？"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "我们直播产品发布页面将新增“标准直播”和“低延迟直播”两个独立选项，原有发布流程不变。您之前实际使用的是后台统一配置的低延迟链路，您知道吗？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "嗯，知道。那这两个有什么区别？我该选哪个？"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "简单说：标准直播延迟5-10秒，成本低，适合大班课；低延迟直播延迟1-2秒，互动好，适合小班课或实操课。需要实时互动就选低延迟。"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "低延迟是不是更贵？"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "是的，低延迟直播链路和节点保障更强，成本通常高于标准直播。不过您之前用的就是低延迟，费用配置应该已经熟悉了。"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "user", "content": "那我现在怎么操作？我在Web控制台发布课程，没看到低延迟选项啊？"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "agent", "content": "如果Web控制台暂未显示，可能是后台配置未完成，稍后刷新或联系平台确认。另外，您也可以通过校验系统A或SaaS系统B发布课程，那里也能配置。"}, {"turn": 10, "role": "user", "content": "我用的是SaaS系统B，怎么配置低延迟？"}, {"turn": 11, "role": "agent", "content": "进入“我的”页面，找到直播平台设置，选择直播平台后，在产品配置中勾选低延迟直播即可。"}, {"turn": 12, "role": "user", "content": "那学员课包抵扣或直播链路费用，低延迟也能用吗？"}, {"turn": 13, "role": "agent", "content": "可以。如果已经配置相关费用，低延迟直播也适用；如无法确认，可进入费用配置页编辑低延迟直播对应费用后保存。"}, {"turn": 14, "role": "user", "content": "好的，明白了。还有其他事吗？"}, {"turn": 15, "role": "agent", "content": "后续我们会通过企业微信发送通知，您需通过验证或同步提示。没有其他问题的话，祝您工作顺利，再见！"}, {"turn": 16, "role": "user", "content": "再见。"}], "tool_calls": [], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "opened", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 10, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 11, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 12, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 13, "task_status": "completed", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 14, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 15, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 16, "task_status": "explained", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
{"run_id": "run_d9626373746f", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_009", "task_id": "course_live_task", "scenario_id": "s09_rejection", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "您好，请问您是贵培训机构或校区的负责人吗？"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "是的，有什么事？"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "我们课程发布页面将新增“标准直播”和“低延迟直播”两个独立选项，想跟您介绍一下。原有发布流程不变。您之前实际使用的是后台统一配置的低延迟链路，您知道吗？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "知道，但我觉得现在这样挺好的，不想改什么设置。"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "理解。不过新增选项后，您可以根据课程场景选择：标准直播延迟5-10秒，成本较低，适合大班课；低延迟直播延迟1-2秒，互动更好，适合小班课或实操课。费用上低延迟会高一些。您是通过Web控制台、校验系统A还是SaaS系统B发布课程？我可以指导您查看配置。"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "我用Web控制台，但真的不想动，现在够用了。"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，完全尊重您的决定。如果以后需要调整，随时联系我们。后续我们会通过企业微信发送通知，您注意查收。那今天先这样，祝您工作顺利！"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "user", "content": "好的，谢谢，再见。"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 6, "tool_name": "record_rejection", "arguments": {"user_id": "user_001", "task_id": "course_live_task", "reason": "客户拒绝调整直播配置，认为现有流程够用"}, "result": {"status": "rejected", "rejection_id": "virtual_rejection_001"}, "latency_ms": 80, "error_code": null}], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "opened", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "rejected", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "rejected", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "rejected", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
{"run_id": "run_d9626373746f", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_010", "task_id": "course_live_task", "scenario_id": "s10_faq_cost", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "您好，请问您是贵培训机构或校区的负责人吗？"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "是的，我是负责人，有什么事？"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，我们课程发布页面将新增“标准直播”和“低延迟直播”两个独立选项，原有发布流程不变。想跟您说明一下。您之前知道实际使用的是后台统一配置的低延迟链路吗？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "嗯，不太清楚，我们一直用后台默认的。那这两个有什么区别？"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "标准直播成本较低，延迟约5-10秒，适合大班课；低延迟直播延迟约1-2秒，互动体验更好，适合小班课或实操课。低延迟直播链路和节点保障更强，成本通常高于标准直播。您是通过Web控制台、校验系统A还是SaaS系统B发布课程？"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "我们用Web控制台。那低延迟直播是不是更贵？"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "是的，低延迟直播成本通常高于标准直播。不过您可以根据课程场景选择，如果不需要实时互动，标准直播更经济。您可以在Web控制台发布页面看到这两个选项，如果暂时看不到，可能是后台配置未完成，稍后刷新或联系平台确认。另外，如果您的学员使用课包抵扣或直播链路费用配置，低延迟直播也可配置该费用，您需要我指导设置路径吗？"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "user", "content": "费用配置我们之前已经设好了，低延迟直播也能用那个费用吗？"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "agent", "content": "如果已经配置相关费用，可确认低延迟直播也使用该费用；如无法确认，可进入费用配置页编辑低延迟直播对应费用后保存。后续我们会通过企业微信发送通知，您需通过验证或同步提示。您还有其他问题吗？"}, {"turn": 10, "role": "user", "content": "没有了，谢谢。"}, {"turn": 11, "role": "agent", "content": "不客气，祝您工作顺利！"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 4, "tool_name": "query_faq", "arguments": {"task_id": "course_live_task", "question": "标准直播和低延迟直播有什么区别？"}, "result": {"status": "faq_answered", "answer": "标准直播成本较低，延迟约5-10秒，适合大班课；低延迟直播延迟约1-2秒，互动体验更好，适合小班课或实操课。"}, "latency_ms": 50, "error_code": null}, {"turn": 6, "tool_name": "query_faq", "arguments": {"task_id": "course_live_task", "question": "低延迟直播是否更贵？"}, "result": {"status": "faq_answered", "answer": "低延迟直播链路和节点保障更强，成本通常高于标准直播。"}, "latency_ms": 45, "error_code": null}], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "opened", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"tu